/// processors themselves result in an (uncaught) error then the `result_map` will not be
/// executed. If the `result_map` fails the message will remain unchanged. Under any of
/// these conditions standard [error handling methods](/docs/configuration/error_handling)
/// can be used in order to filter, DLQ or recover the failed messages.
///
/// ### Conditional Branching
